  },
  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>Quando você <strong><em>se Equipa</em></strong>, marque uma quantidade de ◇ abaixo, em itens específicos ou em Indefinido.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>Para uma <strong>carga leve</strong> (<em>rápido e silencioso</em>), marque até 3 ◇</li>\n<li>Para uma <strong>carga normal</strong>, marque 4-6 ◇</li>\n<li>Para uma <strong>carga pesada</strong> (<em>barulhento, lento, quente, cansa rápido</em>), marque 7-9 ◇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">Indefinido</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"Marca 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Marca 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"Marca 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Marca 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"Marca 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Marca 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"Marca 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Marca 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"Marca 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Marca 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"Marca 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Marca 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"Marca 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"Marca 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"Marca 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"Marca 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"Marca 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"Marca 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Quando você <strong><em>Tem o Necessário</em></strong>, mova uma marca daqui para um ◇ específico abaixo.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">Equipamento</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Suprimentos</strong> (4+Prosperidade usos ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Mais suprimentos</strong> (4+Prosperidade usos ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Ainda mais suprimentos</strong> (4+Prosperidade usos ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>Use suprimentos para Recuperar-se, Acampar ou ter itens <em>pequenos</em> extras.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>Kit de cozinha</strong> (requer fogo e água; faz os Suprimentos durarem mais)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>Esteira de dormir</strong> (recupere 1d6 HP extras quando você Acampa)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>Cobertor</strong> (<em>quente</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>Muda de roupa</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>Corda</strong>, ~8 metros</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>Pá</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>Trenó/padiola/zorra</strong>, enrolável</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>Raquetes de neve</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>Tocha</strong> (dura ~1 hora; <em>alcance</em>, <em>área</em>, <em>perigosa</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>Lamparina a óleo</strong> (○○○ horas, <em>perto</em>, <em>área</em>, <em>tosca</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>Óleo extra</strong> (○○○○○ horas, para lamparina/lanterna, inútil como arma)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>Lenha</strong> (o bastante para 1 noite inteira, <em>alcance</em>, <em>área</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>Machadinha</strong>, de ferro (<em>mão</em>, <em>arremesso</em>, x perfurante)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>Malho</strong>, de ferro e/ou madeira (<em>mão</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>Picareta</strong>, de ferro (<em>perto</em>, x perfurante, <em>cruento</em>, <em>desajeitada</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>Marreta</strong>, de ferro (<em>perto</em>, <em>vigoroso</em>, <em>desajeitada</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>Bordão</strong> (<em>perto</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>Lança</strong>, de ferro (<em>perto</em>, <em>arremesso</em>, x perfurante)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>Lança longa</strong>, de ferro (<em>alcance</em>, x perfurante)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>Arco e flechas de ferro</strong> (<em>próximo</em>, x perfurante, ○ pouca munição, ○ esgotada)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>Flechas extras</strong> (x perfurante, ○ de sobra, ○ poucas, ○ esgotadas)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>Azagaias</strong>, algumas, de ferro (<em>arremesso</em>, x perfurante, +1 de dano, ○ esgotadas)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>Escudo</strong> (+1 armadura, +1 Prontidão com 7+ ao Defender)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>Peles grossas</strong> (1 armadura, <em>quentes</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>Capa</strong> (<em>quente</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">Posses, itens, espólio</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Item\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Item\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Item\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Item\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Item\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Item\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Item\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"Espaço\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Item\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">Outras coisas</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(animais, kits, itens escondidos etc.)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"Outras coisas\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">Itens pequenos</h3>\n<p>Cabem num bolso, numa bolsa ou numa bota. Quando você <strong><em>se Equipa</em></strong>, marque ☐ abaixo igual a 4+Prosperidade.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">Indefinido</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"Marca 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Marca 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"Marca 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Marca 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"Marca 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Marca 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"Marca 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Marca 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"Marca 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Marca 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"Marca 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Marca 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Quando você <strong><em>Tem o Necessário</em></strong>, mova uma marca daqui para os itens abaixo, ou gaste suprimentos para marcar um ☐ adicional.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>Faca ou adaga</strong>, de ferro (<em>mão</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>Funda</strong> (<em>próximo</em>, <em>recarga</em>, <em>desajeitada</em>, ○ pouca munição, ○ esgotada)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-rushlight\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rushlight\" data-check-id=\"inv-rushlight\"> <span><strong>Vela de junco</strong> (dura ~15-30 minutos, <em>mão</em>, <em>tosca</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-tinderbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wik